kens.test.ts tests radar.css by regex on its text (light-theme token overrides, flat --radar-ground, square seams on .radar-modes/.radar-kpi, no old cyan color). It has no assertions on radar-clock or landing-brand, and no font-size assertions for them.\n- Radar.test.tsx checks radar-clock-local (lines 663 and 1004) and radar-clock-utc (line 664) by test id and text, so keep those test ids and text formats.\n\nTool notes: this shell is BusyBox. grep does not support --include, and git is not installed, so use plain grep -rn with pipes and sed -n for line ranges.\n\nNext: re-read the ticket text and decide which of these elements it concerns (most likely the radar header clock or brand styling in radar.css or Radar.tsx), then make the smallest edit and keep the clock test ids and tokens.test.ts regexes passing."
